{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりん「今日朝な、ドアに\n指はさんで痛いねん」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか「え！ドアってどこの？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりん「玄関の」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか「ドジっ子さゆりん」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆりん「うん！ドジっ子さゆりん！\nってブログに書いて！」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...っていわれたから書きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっきの話"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合唱コンクールの思い出ある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中3の合唱コンで\nソロパート歌いました！\nでも下手くそ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"語尾にぷう、まりかもやってる？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やってるぷう～\nでも、ねねのブログ読んだら\nうざかったからブログには\n書かなかったぷう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水泳得意ですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泳げません。\nクロールしてる姿なんて\n顔が必死すぎて見せられません←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"制服は夏服が好き?冬服が好き?"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂制服はすきだけど、\n普段学校でブレザーは動きにくいから\nあんまりすきじゃない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもカーディガンすきだから冬！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜景で好きな所はドコ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くわしくない"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりかってさー照れ屋さんだよね？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月とかせいたんに\nデレデレすんなってツッコまれる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな靴は？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゴツいブーツとかペタンコすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近まっちゅんとの仲はどうなん？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い朝の一杯に何を飲みたい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホット豆乳きなこ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メダカ・カメ・ネコどれ好き？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のブログびっくりしてたねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふっふふっふ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キャプテン"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れいかれいかれいかれいかれいか\nれいかれいかれいか......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、、もうやめます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今休憩中。\n溜まってる授業のノート書こーっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらば"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/11/07/7845473/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}